daśā(kṣa)radvayaśaktipūjākramaṃ copadiśati | tatra 
caturdaśā(kṣa)rādāvityatrādiśabdena daśā(kṣa)radvayepi devyāḥ 
agramārabhya aprādakṣiṇyena pūjayedityucyate | vaśaṅkari vaśaṅkarī 
ityarthaḥ | dvayasarvādikāḥ uktabījadvayopari sarvaśabdaṃ 
caturdaśānāmādau yojayet | śaktisaptākṣarī ityatra śakti 
ityakṣaradvayameva gṛhyate na tu visarjanīyahrīṃkārāviti sampradāyaḥ | 
krameṇa uddiṣṭakrameṇa | śaktipratyekaṃ pratikoṇaṃ 
devyagrakoṇamārabhya pūjayedityarthaḥ | hrī(/) śrī(/) 
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīśaktipādukāṃ pūjayāmi | evamanyān 
trayodaśamantrān yojayet || 77 || 78 || 79 ||

