sarvasiddhipradādevīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi | evamanye'pi navamantrā 
yojanīyāḥ || 83 ||
	jñānetyādinā yajedityantena ślokatrayeṇa ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇe 
