tatra jñā sarvajñetyarthaḥ | prāgvat hrī(/) śrī(/) sarvajñā devīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmi | evamanyānapi navamantrān yojayet || 84 || 85 || 86 ||
	antarityādinā ślokena saptamāvaraṇe aṣṭāre pūjyaśaktyaṣṭakasya 
mantrā(/)statpūjākramaṃ copadiśati | tatra paścimāt agramārabhya 
prāgvaditi vargabījādi yojanaviṣayaḥ saptākṣaryā sārddhamiti śeṣaḥ | 
namaḥ pade nyāsakramaproktanamaḥ śabdamapāsya tatsthāne 
