<p. 82> madhyasthadevī tvekaiva ṣoḍaśākārataḥ sthitā |
yatastasmāttanau tasyā anyāḥ pañcadaśārcayet || 90 ||

madhyatrikoṇakoṇeṣu paścimādapradakṣiṇam |
kāmeśvarīṃ savajreśīṃ tathā ca bhagamālinīm || 91 ||

pūrvadvayaṃ tato vidyā tvekaikaṃ pīṭhanāma ca |
tato nāmāni śaktīnāṃ devīsaptākṣarīyutam || 92 ||

taistāḥ samarccayet paścāt madhye devīṃ tathā'rcayet |
dvayaṃ samastāṃ vidyāṃ ca pīṭhadevyabhidhāyutām || 93 ||

devīsaptākṣaropetamityuktaṃ tava pūjanam |
praticakraṃ ca madhyasthāṃ vidyayā navanāmabhiḥ || 94 ||

