krameṇānyā naṣṭau yojayet | atra mantranavake'pi bījadvayayojanaṃ na 
syāditi sampradāyaḥ | navame ca śrīśabdadvayaprayogaḥ syāt 
sampradāyataḥ | tat taditi dvividhaṃ pūjanaṃ dvayamiti bījayadvayaṃ | 
guṇān prakaṭādikān | śrīśaktisaṃjñāguṇān | te'pi pañcame paṭale 
dvādaśatrayodaśābhyāṃ ślokābhyāṃ proktāḥ | yoginya iti proktā 
ityatrānveti | prokteti divyatvāt | 
abhidhāmāvṛternavānāmāvaraṇacakrāṇāṃ trailokyamohanādikāḥ 
saṃjñāḥ | tāśca pañcame paṭale navadaśamābhyāṃ abhihitāḥ | te 
yathā hrī(/) śrī(/) etāḥ prakaṭayoginyastrailokyamohane cakre pūjāṃ 
gṛhṇantviti | evamanyānapyaṣṭau

