pūjayedityarthaḥ | nāmanāmnā nāmarūpayā vidyayā sūkṣmaṃ rūpaṃ 
pūjayediti yāvat | mantratanuṃ akṣaravigrahamityarthaḥ | etat 
sūkṣmarūpamityanenānveti | devyāḥ 
sūkṣmarūpamityakṣarātmakamityarthaḥ | pararūpaṃ 
deśakālādibhiranavacchinnam | arpaṇena pūjānivedanena pūjayediti śeṣaḥ | 
