tathā pratipaddhomavat | viśeṣeṇa vahnivāsinyāḥ asādhāraṇatithitvāt | 
prāgvat pratipaddhomavat || 31 || tasyāṃ pañcamyām | sitaiḥ puṣpairitiśeṣaḥ 
|| 32 || tāni sarvāṇi sarvadā ghṛtahomādavāpnoti ghṛtahomātsarvāṇīṣṭāni 
vastūni avāpnotītyanvayaḥ || 33 || vratī bhavet svasaṅkalpasahitaḥ || 34 ||
	pratipadityādibhirācaredityantaiḥ pañcabhiḥ ślokaiḥ 
pañcadaśānāṃ nityānāṃ yathākramaṃ pañcadaśatithimayattvaṃ 
tattithiṣu tattadvidyāprāptiṃ bhajanaviśeṣaṃ copadiśati | tatra 
ekaikavigrahāḥ ekaikatithirūpāḥ | vratasaṅkalpaḥ prāgvat || 35 || 36 || 
yattithau yāsu tithiṣvityarthaḥ || 37 || 38 || akhilaṃ prayogādi |

