	mahāvajramityādibhirvarṇayedityantairnavabhiḥ 
ślokairmahāvajrayantraprayogaviśeṣā(/)statphalāni copadiśati | tatra 
proktakramāt lalitāproktakramataḥ || 74 || 75 || 76 || 77 || 78 || 79 || prāgvat dinaiḥ 
māsādibhiḥ | gaje sthāpayitveti śeṣaḥ || 80 || 81 ||

