pūrṇamaṇḍalasaṃkhyayā saṃguṇayya tasthau sākā vālā iti 331776 
ṣaḍakṣaravākyajanitasaṃkhyā bhavatīti | tribhirakṣarairjātā bhedā etāneva 
pūrṇamaṇḍalasaṃkhyayā saṃguṇayya tasthau dhīro nityākalaṅka iti 
191102976 navākṣaravākyajanitasaṃkhyā bhavantīti | evamuttaratrāpi 
tattadbhedān pūrṇamaṇḍalasaṃkhyayā saṃguṇayya evaṃ 
