<p. 698> tadadho varddhayedrekhāstattatsaṃkhyāṅgulāvadhi |
tiryyagrekhāstāvatīśca kṛtvā teṣvaṅkamālikhet || 36 || 

savyadakṣasthiteṣveṣu koṣṭhapaṃktiṣvanukramāt |
ādye dvidvikramādaṅkān pūrayettatra coditān || 37 || 

etenānyatra sarvatra deyānaṅkānanukramāt |
dvitīyapaṃktau prathame khaṇḍe śeṣāṃstu pūrayet || 38 || 

