<p. 699> dvitīyādiṣvapi tathā śeṣān khaṇḍeṣu pūrayet |
[tṛtīyapaṃktau tu śeṣaistvevameva samālikhet || 39 || 

caturthādiṣvapi tathā navamāntaṃ samālikhet |]
tiryyakpaṃktiṣvanabhyastakramamaṅkāstu sarvataḥ || 40 || 

