khaṇḍaṃ tāvat prāgvadaśūnyaṃ śeṣaṃ vibhajya tatphalaṃ tadadhodhaḥ 
saṃsthāpya tattatphalaṃ saikaṃ kṛtvā bhāgahārābhāve śiṣṭamekaṃ 
tatphalapaṃktyāmadhaḥ saṃsthāpya 
